title|The Ascent
v_from|71
v_to|76
scenes|scene_09_ufo_abduction.txt
beat|As Lucky ascended into the light he looked down upon the city growing smaller beneath him and perceived that the life he had known was ending; for beyond the stars a greater conflict awaited him, not between nations only, but between powers hidden since the foundation of the world. Conclude the chapter with a revelation pointing toward what is to come: Thus ended the days of ignorance, and thus began the journey of the Soul Pen.

